<title>JAPAN: BOJ drains 400 bln yen from money market - traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ drains 400 bln yen from money market - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 400 billion yen from the money market on Monday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The money market had a fund surplus of 410 billion yen going into the day.</p>
